{
  "key": 50255,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_WhatTimingYouveGotToHelpDawn",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "What timing!\r",
        "Those Team Galactic scoundrels are\n",
        "after the legendary Pokémon!\r",
        "You’ve got to help Dawn!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_WhatTimingYouveGotToHelpLucas",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "What timing!\r",
        "Those Team Galactic scoundrels are\n",
        "after the legendary Pokémon!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, help us!\n",
        "You’ve got to help Lucas!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_HowDareYouMisguidedThugs",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: How dare you!\n",
        "You misguided thugs!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_DawnNeedsYourHelp",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Dawn needs your help!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_HowDareYouMisguidedThugsUnused",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: How dare you!\n",
        "You misguided thugs!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LucasNeedsYourHelp",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Lucas needs your help!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_OuchWhatsWithThisOldTimer",
      "en_US": [
        "Ow! Ouch!\n",
        "What’s with this old-timer?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_DawnICouldntBeatThisPerson",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s T-Team Galactic!\r",
        "They’re taking the Pokémon of the\n",
        "lake...\r",
        "I...\n",
        "I couldn’t beat this person..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LucasILostToHerButJustBarely",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: It’s Team Galactic!\n",
        "They took the Pokémon of the lake...\r",
        "This woman...\n",
        "I lost to her, but just barely!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_MarsIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Mars: That face...!\n",
        "It brings back bad memories!\r",
        "I’m talking about the windworks!\r",
        "I caught a whole lot of trouble\n",
        "for that little incident.\r",
        "What’s with that look on your face?\n",
        "You do remember me, don’t you?\r",
        "Fine, whatever.\n",
        "I’ll tell you who I am again!\r",
        "I’m Mars, one of Team Galactic’s\n",
        "Commanders.\r",
        "So, what is it? Are you some\n",
        "lovey-dovey couple to the rescue?\r",
        "Not a chance! Not even a teeny one!\n",
        "You’re all going down!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_MarsDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "I lost again...\r",
        "So, first the windworks, and now\n",
        "Lake Verity that I owe you for!\r",
        "This shouldn’t be happening to Team\n",
        "Galactic’s Commander...\r",
        "...Calm down, Mars...\n",
        "I’ve done my part in all of this...\r",
        "My mission was to transport the\n",
        "lake’s Pokémon to our HQ...\r",
        "...That’s right! I accomplished my\n",
        "mission without a problem!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_WerePullingOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Team! We’re pulling out!\n",
        "The boss is waiting at the HQ!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_NowWeveGotAllLakePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon of the three lakes are\n",
        "connected somehow.\r",
        "Thanks to Saturn’s grandstanding at\n",
        "Lake Valor, a cavern appeared here.\r",
        "It was the cavern where the Pokémon\n",
        "MESPRIT slept.\r",
        "MESPRIT appeared, too, probably to\n",
        "go help its friends.\r",
        "That worked out well for us.\n",
        "It was super easy to catch.\r",
        "So, now we’ve got them all:\n",
        "MESPRIT, “The Being of Emotion.”\f",
        "AZELF, “The Being of Willpower.”\f",
        "UXIE, “The Being of Intelligence.”\r",
        "Now that we have them all...\r",
        "You can look forward to what plans\n",
        "Team Galactic has for them!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_WhatIsHappeningAtLakeAcuity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I see...\n",
        "This also occurred at Lake Valor...\r",
        "Another legendary Pokémon was taken\n",
        "away by Team Galactic...\r",
        "Both of you went up against\n",
        "full-fledged criminals...\r",
        "The fact that you’re unharmed is\n",
        "reason enough to celebrate.\r",
        "...But what about {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
        "What is happening at Lake Acuity?\n",
        "Is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} safe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_INeedYouToGoToLakeAcuity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I need you to\n",
        "go to Lake Acuity right away.\r",
        "I’m worried about {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_DawnWhatIsTeamGalacticUpTo",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what is Team\n",
        "Galactic up to?\r",
        "Are the abducted Pokémon of the\n",
        "lakes going to be OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LucasWhatsTeamGalacticUpTo",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what’s Team\n",
        "Galactic up to?\r",
        "They’d better not harm the Pokémon\n",
        "they took from the lakes..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LaunchpadDormant",
      "en_US": [
        "A dark rift swirls across\n",
        "the terrace.\r",
        "It hums faintly, but something\n",
        "seems to hold it shut..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LaunchpadPortalOpen",
      "en_US": [
        "A dark rift swirls across\n",
        "the terrace.\r",
        "It seems to be pulling at you...\n",
        "Step into the rift?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_DrawbridgeSign",
      "en_US": [
        "VERITY CASTLE\n",
        "The drawbridge is down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_RowanNoLegendaryPokemonHowWasLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hmmm...\r",
        "No legendary Pokémon, nothing out\n",
        "of the ordinary...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was Lake Valor?\n",
        "Anything to report?\r",
        "What? You're just going there now?\n",
        "You've got to move faster than that!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_RowanHowWasLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was Lake\n",
        "Valor? Anything to report?\r",
        "What? You're just going there now?\n",
        "You've got to move faster than that!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_DawnHowHasLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, how was\n",
        "Lake Valor?\r",
        "There's nothing wrong here.\n",
        "The lake hasn't changed at all.\r",
        "We haven't found a legendary\n",
        "Pokémon, either, though..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LucasHowsLakeValor",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How's Lake Valor?\r",
        "There's nothing wrong here.\n",
        "The lake is ordinary, as usual.\r",
        "There's no legendary Pokémon,\n",
        "either..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusWhereAmI",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Where am I?\n",
        "Is this a dream?\r",
        "This is not the Distortion World.\r",
        "Time flows here.\n",
        "Space holds its shape."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusTheFall",
      "en_US": [
        "The fall...\r",
        "Did the shadow cast me out?\r",
        "Or did I finally fall far enough\n",
        "to escape it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusWasIWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "...Was I wrong?\r",
        "No. The logic was sound.\r",
        "And yet... the world remains.\n",
        "I remain."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryDidYouHearThat",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, did you hear that?\n",
        "Something's going on up at the\f",
        "castle! We have to go see!\r",
        "Stay out of the tall grass, though.\n",
        "We don't have any Pokémon yet!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusThereWasNeverACastle",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: A castle...\n",
        "on Lake Verity?\r",
        "There was never a castle here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryUpThoseStairs",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hear those voices?\n",
        "Somebody's up there, all right!\r",
        "Come on, up those stairs!\n",
        "Last one up owes me 10 million!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanChildren",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hm? Children?\n",
        "This is no place for sightseeing!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryWeCameToHelp",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: We saw you on the news,\n",
        "Professor! We came to help!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CounterpartTheReadings",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}: Professor, the readings\n",
        "still make no sense.\r",
        "It's like the space in there\n",
        "doesn't sit still.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanMyBriefcase",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Hmm...\r",
        "When that portal tore open, people\n",
        "panicked. I helped them escape...\r",
        "and in the rush, I dropped my\n",
        "briefcase. The portal swallowed it.\r",
        "There are three Pokémon inside.\n",
        "Starter Pokémon, for new Trainers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanHaveWeMet",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: And you, sir. You came out\n",
        "of that portal, didn't you?\r",
        "Forgive me, I don't believe\n",
        "we've met. Are you hurt?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusHeDoesntKnowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...\r",
        "...He doesn't know me.\r",
        "In this world, perhaps there is\n",
        "no reason he should."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryWeGoIn",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Then it's simple!\r",
        "We go in, grab the briefcase,\n",
        "and come right back out!\r",
        "And then you'll owe us starter\n",
        "Pokémon, right, Professor?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanIForbidIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Absolutely not!\r",
        "That world twists back on itself.\n",
        "Up, down, near, far... it all bends.\r",
        "It's no place to wander blind.\n",
        "I forbid it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusIWillGuideThem",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...I came from that world.\r",
        "It is confusing, but I know\n",
        "its ways.\r",
        "If someone must go, I will go.\n",
        "I'll guide the way to the briefcase."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryLetsGo",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: You heard him!\n",
        "Let's go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanComeBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: W-wait! Come back here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusNoTimeToLose",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...Then there is no time\n",
        "to lose. I'll look after him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CounterpartTheyreInside",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}: Professor!\n",
        "They're both inside!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanDontFollowThem",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: That reckless boy...!\r",
        "And you! Don't even think\n",
        "about following them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CounterpartTheBriefcaseIsInThere",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}: W-wait!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is still in there!\r",
        "And the briefcase is in there,\n",
        "too..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanThatWorldIsNoPlace",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I said no, and I meant it.\r",
        "That world is no place for you.\n",
        "I'll find a way to reach them..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CounterpartReadingsHolding",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}: The readings are holding.\n",
        "The portal's staying open...\r",
        "...for now, anyway."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1StepIntoThePortal",
      "en_US": [
        "The portal swirls, dark and deep.\n",
        "The briefcase is somewhere inside...\r",
        "Step into the portal?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanYoureBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: You're back!\n",
        "All of you... Thank goodness.\r",
        "You went in after I told you\n",
        "not to. Reckless...\r",
        "...And brave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1HandedTheBriefcase",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} handed the briefcase\n",
        "to Professor Rowan."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanADealIsADeal",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: All three are safe...\r",
        "I made no promise... but you kept\n",
        "your end of it all the same.\r",
        "Very well. A deal is a deal -\n",
        "the starters are yours."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CounterpartItsClosing",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}: Professor!\n",
        "Readings are dropping, it's closing!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1RowanItsGone",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: ...It's gone.\r",
        "You two. Once you've rested, come\n",
        "by my lab in Sandgem Town.\r",
        "Come, {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}. We have a great\n",
        "deal of data to go over."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusYouRemindMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: You two...\r",
        "You remind me of somebody\n",
        "I knew before.\r",
        "They had this fire within them.\r",
        "I once called that fire a flaw.\n",
        "Something to be purged.\r",
        "...It is the reason I am still\n",
        "standing.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusShowTheProfessor",
      "en_US": [
        "This was inside that Mawile.\n",
        "Show it to the professor.\r",
        "Not me. Not yet.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1CyrusINeedToUnderstand",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I need to understand what\n",
        "I am, here, before I stand in\f",
        "front of anyone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryPerfectTiming",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Phew!\n",
        "Perfect timing on our part.\r",
        "I'm still not sure what to make\n",
        "of that guy...\r",
        "And man, he is wearing some\n",
        "weird clothing.\r",
        "Whatever. I'm heading home to\n",
        "heal my Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryNoPokemonNoGrass",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Whoa!\n",
        "No Pokémon, no grass!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1NoPokemonNoGrass",
      "en_US": [
        "Better not go into the tall grass\n",
        "without any Pokémon..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryWhereAreYouGoing",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey! Where are you\n",
        "going? The castle's this way!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_Arc1BarryNotInThere",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Not in there!\n",
        "That noise came from the top!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
